<!--
  BRAND-01A — adaptive launcher icon background.

  Warm cream sampled from the approved LIGHT app-icon source
  (assets/branding/bismillah_app_icon_light.png). It is deliberately a flat
  COLOUR rather than a bitmap: the adaptive background is parallax-shifted and
  mask-cropped by the launcher, so a flat brand surface can never show a seam,
  a scaling artefact or a cropped edge.

  This is the icon plate cream, not the in-app AppColors.background (#F7F3EA).
  The two are intentionally different: the launcher plate follows the approved
  icon artwork, the app surface follows the product theme.
-->
<resources>
    <color name="ic_launcher_background">#FEF2E2</color>
</resources>
